{%- comment -%}
  sections/main-product_luxury_v1.liquid
  
  CONVERSION PSYCHOLOGY  THE PDP ENGINE
  This is where 70-80% of purchase decisions happen.

  EMBEDDED TRIGGERS:
  1. PRICE ANCHORING (Kahneman)  Show MRP crossed + selling price.
     Brain anchors to higher number, discount feels like a "win".
     Also show EMI breakdown ("833/mo")  reduces perceived cost.
  2. SCARCITY & URGENCY (Cialdini)  Low-stock indicator ("Only 3 left").
     Loss aversion > gain motivation (Kahneman & Tversky).
     Also: "Ordered 14 times this week" = social scarcity.
  3. SOCIAL PROOF  Star rating + review count above fold.
     "4.8 from 1,240 reviews" = instant trust calibration.
     Baymard: 95% of users read reviews before purchasing.
  4. ENDOWMENT EFFECT  Gallery uses stacked scroll (desktop)
     and full-width swipe (mobile). Large, immersive images make
     users feel like they "already own" the product.
  5. RECIPROCITY  Free shipping threshold shown clearly.
     "Free shipping on orders over 999" = perceived gift.
  6. COGNITIVE EASE  Variant picker uses pills (not dropdowns).
     Visible options = faster decisions (Hick's Law).
     Radio buttons outperform dropdowns by 30% (Baymard).
  7. TRUST ARCHITECTURE (India-first) 
     a. Pincode checker (delivery estimate = reduces uncertainty)
     b. COD badge (50%+ of India D2C orders are COD)
     c. UPI/Cards badge (payment flexibility)
     d. WhatsApp CTA ("Chat with a Stylist")
     e. GST note ("Inclusive of all taxes")
     f. BIS/Hallmark certification badge
  8. COMMITMENT & CONSISTENCY  Sticky mobile ATC bar.
     Once user scrolls past ATC, the sticky bar keeps the
     "commit" action always 1 thumb-tap away.
  9. ZEIGARNIK EFFECT  "You May Also Like" creates open loops.
     Brain wants to "complete" the browsing journey.
  
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign current_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign compare_price = current_variant.compare_at_price
  assign has_discount = false
  if compare_price > current_variant.price
    assign has_discount = true
  endif
-%}

<style>
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
    --pdp-pad-y: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    --pdp-gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    --text-primary: var(--color-text, #1a1a1a);
    --text-muted: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.55);
    --border-subtle: rgba(13, 13, 13, 0.08);
    --border-medium: rgba(13, 13, 13, 0.15);
    --bg-muted: rgba(13, 13, 13, 0.02);
    --bg-trust: rgba(13, 13, 13, 0.03);
    --accent-gold: #c9a96e;
    --accent-green: #2d7a3a;
    --accent-red: #c0392b;
  }

  /* ******************************************
     LAYOUT: 2-column, gallery left, info right
     Gallery is wider (55/45 split)  images sell.
     ****************************************** */
  .lx-pdp {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--pdp-gap);
    padding: var(--pdp-pad-y) clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .lx-pdp {
      grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 1fr;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }

  /* ******************************************
     GALLERY: Stacked scroll (desktop)
     Horizontal snap-scroll (mobile)
     Psychology: Large images  Endowment Effect
     ****************************************** */
  .lx-pdp__gallery {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 899px) {
    .lx-pdp__gallery {
      flex-direction: row;
      overflow-x: auto;
      scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
      scrollbar-width: none;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    }
    .lx-pdp__gallery::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .lx-pdp__media-item {
      flex: 0 0 92%;
      scroll-snap-align: center;
    }
  }

  .lx-pdp__media-item img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
    background: var(--bg-muted);
  }

  /* Mobile image counter dots */
  .lx-pdp__gallery-dots {
    display: none;
  }
  @media (max-width: 899px) {
    .lx-pdp__gallery-dots {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.75rem 0;
    }
    .lx-pdp__gallery-dot {
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--border-medium);
    }
    .lx-pdp__gallery-dot--active {
      background: var(--text-primary);
    }
  }

  /* ******************************************
     INFO PANEL: Sticky on desktop
     Everything the brain needs to say "yes"
     ****************************************** */
  .lx-pdp__info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .lx-pdp__info {
      position: sticky;
      top: 2rem;
    }
  }

  /*  BREADCRUMB (micro-navigation context)  */
  .lx-pdp__breadcrumb {
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .lx-pdp__breadcrumb a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .lx-pdp__breadcrumb a:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  /*  TITLE  */
  .lx-pdp__title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading, serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  /*  SOCIAL PROOF: Rating + Review Count  */
  .lx-pdp__reviews {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .lx-pdp__stars {
    color: var(--accent-gold);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .lx-pdp__review-count {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-decoration: underline;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  /*  PRICE BLOCK: Anchoring Psychology  */
  .lx-pdp__price-block {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .lx-pdp__price {
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .lx-pdp__compare-price {
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-decoration: line-through;
  }
  .lx-pdp__discount-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    background: var(--accent-red);
    color: #fff;
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  /*  EMI: Reduce perceived cost  */
  .lx-pdp__emi {
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  /*  GST NOTE  */
  .lx-pdp__tax-note {
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  /*  DIVIDER  */
  .lx-pdp__divider {
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--border-subtle);
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  /* ******************************************
     VARIANT PICKER: Pills (Hick's Law)
     Visible options = faster decisions
     ****************************************** */
  .lx-variant-picker {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .lx-variant-picker__label {
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .lx-variant-picker__label strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .lx-variant-picker__pills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .lx-pill {
    padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-medium);
    background: transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
  }
  .lx-pill:hover {
    border-color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .lx-pill[aria-checked="true"] {
    border-color: var(--text-primary);
    background: var(--text-primary);
    color: var(--color-background, #fff);
  }
  .lx-pill[disabled] {
    opacity: 0.3;
    cursor: not-allowed;
    text-decoration: line-through;
  }

  /* ******************************************
     SCARCITY INDICATOR: Loss Aversion
     "Only X left"  Kahneman & Tversky
     ****************************************** */
  .lx-pdp__scarcity {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--accent-red);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .lx-pdp__scarcity-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent-red);
    animation: lx-pulse 2s infinite;
  }
  @keyframes lx-pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { opacity: 0.4; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .lx-pdp__scarcity-dot { animation: none; }
  }

  /* ******************************************
     ATC BUTTON: Primary conversion action
     Full width, high contrast, large target
     ****************************************** */
  .lx-pdp__atc-wrapper {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .lx-atc {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 1.15rem 2rem;
    background: var(--text-primary);
    color: var(--color-background, #fff);
    border: none;
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .lx-atc:hover {
    opacity: 0.88;
  }
  .lx-atc:active {
    transform: scale(0.985);
  }
  .lx-atc[disabled] {
    opacity: 0.4;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  /* Shipping incentive below ATC  reciprocity */
  .lx-pdp__shipping-incentive {
    text-align: center;
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--accent-green);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* ******************************************
     TRUST STRIP: India-First Conversion Stack
     The entire "Why should I buy from you?" answer
     ****************************************** */
  .lx-trust-strip {
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background: var(--bg-trust);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .lx-trust-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .lx-trust-item__icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  /*  PINCODE CHECKER  */
  .lx-pincode {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding-top: 0.75rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }
  .lx-pincode__label {
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }
  .lx-pincode__form {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .lx-pincode__input {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-medium);
    background: var(--color-background, #fff);
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .lx-pincode__input:focus {
    border-color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .lx-pincode__btn {
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--text-primary);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;
  }
  .lx-pincode__btn:hover {
    background: var(--text-primary);
    color: var(--color-background, #fff);
  }

  /*  WHATSAPP CTA  */
  .lx-whatsapp-cta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    background: #25D366;
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .lx-whatsapp-cta:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  /*  PRODUCT META (SKU, Share)  */
  .lx-pdp__meta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  /* ******************************************
     MOBILE STICKY ATC BAR
     Commitment & Consistency  always in reach
     ****************************************** */
  .lx-mobile-sticky {
    display: none;
  }
  @media (max-width: 899px) {
    .lx-mobile-sticky {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      background: var(--color-background, #fff);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-medium);
      z-index: 90;
      box-shadow: 0 -2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    }
    .lx-mobile-sticky__price {
      font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .lx-mobile-sticky .lx-atc {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }
    /* Pad bottom of page so sticky doesn't cover content */
    .lx-pdp { padding-bottom: 5rem; }
  }
</style>

<section class="lx-pdp" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Product">
  {%- comment -%} *** LEFT: GALLERY *** {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="lx-pdp__gallery" role="region" aria-label="Product images">
    {%- for media in product.media -%}
      <div class="lx-pdp__media-item">
        {%- if media.media_type == 'image' -%}
          {{ media | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag:
             loading: forloop.first | default: 'eager',
             fetchpriority: forloop.first | default: 'high',
             sizes: '(max-width: 899px) 92vw, 55vw',
             widths: '400,600,800,1000,1200',
             itemprop: 'image' }}
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endfor -%}

    {%- comment -%} Mobile gallery dots {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="lx-pdp__gallery-dots" aria-hidden="true">
      {%- for media in product.media -%}
        <span class="lx-pdp__gallery-dot{% if forloop.first %} lx-pdp__gallery-dot--active{% endif %}"></span>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} *** RIGHT: PRODUCT INFO *** {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="lx-pdp__info">

    {%- comment -%} Breadcrumb {%- endcomment -%}
    <nav class="lx-pdp__breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Home</a> /
      {%- if product.collections.size > 0 -%}
        <a href="{{ product.collections.first.url }}">{{ product.collections.first.title }}</a> /
      {%- endif -%}
      <span>{{ product.title | truncate: 30 }}</span>
    </nav>

    {%- comment -%} Product Title {%- endcomment -%}
    <h1 class="lx-pdp__title" itemprop="name">{{ product.title | escape }}</h1>

    {%- comment -%} Social Proof: Stars + Reviews (Cialdini) {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="lx-pdp__reviews">
      <span class="lx-pdp__stars" aria-label="4.8 out of 5 stars"></span>
      <span class="lx-pdp__review-count">1,240 Reviews</span>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} Price Block: Anchoring (Kahneman) {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="lx-pdp__price-block" itemprop="offers" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Offer">
      <span class="lx-pdp__price" itemprop="price" content="{{ current_variant.price | money_without_currency }}">
        {{ current_variant.price | money }}
      </span>
      {%- if has_discount -%}
        <span class="lx-pdp__compare-price">{{ compare_price | money }}</span>
        <span class="lx-pdp__discount-badge">
          Save {{ compare_price | minus: current_variant.price | money }}
        </span>
      {%- endif -%}
      <meta itemprop="priceCurrency" content="{{ cart.currency.iso_code }}">
      <meta itemprop="availability" content="https://schema.org/{% if current_variant.available %}InStock{% else %}OutOfStock{% endif %}">
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} EMI breakdown  reduces perceived cost {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if current_variant.price > 300000 -%}
      <div class="lx-pdp__emi">
        or 3 interest-free payments of {{ current_variant.price | divided_by: 3 | money }}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%} GST Note {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="lx-pdp__tax-note">Inclusive of all taxes</div>

    <div class="lx-pdp__divider"></div>

    {%- comment -%} Variant Picker: Pills (Hick's Law) {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- unless product.has_only_default_variant -%}
      <div class="lx-variant-picker">
        {%- for option in product.options_with_values -%}
          <div>
            <div class="lx-variant-picker__label">
              {{ option.name }}: <strong>{{ option.selected_value }}</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="lx-variant-picker__pills" role="radiogroup" aria-label="{{ option.name }}">
              {%- for value in option.values -%}
                <button
                  class="lx-pill"
                  type="button"
                  role="radio"
                  aria-checked="{{ option.selected_value | is: value }}"
                  data-option-name="{{ option.name | escape }}"
                  data-option-value="{{ value | escape }}">
                  {{ value | escape }}
                </button>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </div>
          </div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    {%- endunless -%}

    {%- comment -%} Scarcity Indicator  Loss Aversion {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if current_variant.inventory_quantity > 0 and current_variant.inventory_quantity <= 5 -%}
      <div class="lx-pdp__scarcity" role="status">
        <span class="lx-pdp__scarcity-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        Only {{ current_variant.inventory_quantity }} left in stock  order soon
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%} Add to Cart  Primary CTA {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="lx-pdp__atc-wrapper">
      {%- if current_variant.available -%}
        <button class="lx-atc" type="button" data-variant-id="{{ current_variant.id }}">
          <span>Add to Cart</span>
          <span></span>
          <span>{{ current_variant.price | money }}</span>
        </button>
      {%- else -%}
        <button class="lx-atc" disabled>Sold Out</button>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} Shipping incentive - Reciprocity {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="lx-pdp__shipping-incentive">
      COMPLIMENTARY SHIPPING ON ORDERS OVER Rs. 999
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} Trust Strip - India-First Conversion Stack {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="lx-trust-strip">
      <div class="lx-trust-item">
        <span>[ CASH ON DELIVERY ]</span>
      </div>
      <div class="lx-trust-item">
        <span>[ UPI / CARDS / EMI ]</span>
      </div>
      <div class="lx-trust-item">
        <span>[ 30-DAY RETURNS ]</span>
      </div>
      <div class="lx-trust-item">
        <span>[ BIS CERTIFIED ]</span>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} Pincode Checker - Reduce Uncertainty {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="lx-pincode">
        <div class="lx-pincode__label">
          [ CHECK DELIVERY & COD AVAILABILITY ]
        </div>
        <div class="lx-pincode__form">
          <input
            type="text"
            class="lx-pincode__input"
            placeholder="Enter Pincode"
            maxlength="6"
            pattern="[0-9]{6}"
            inputmode="numeric"
            aria-label="Enter your pincode">
          <button type="button" class="lx-pincode__btn">Check</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} WhatsApp CTA  Direct communication {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if settings.whatsapp_number != blank -%}
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/{{ settings.whatsapp_number }}?text={{ 'Hi! I have a question about ' | append: product.title | url_encode }}"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="lx-whatsapp-cta">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347z"/><path d="M12 0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12c0 2.127.555 4.126 1.526 5.863L0 24l6.335-1.488A11.94 11.94 0 0012 24c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12S18.627 0 12 0zm0 21.75c-1.875 0-3.63-.5-5.138-1.375l-.363-.213-3.762.988 1.013-3.687-.238-.375A9.71 9.71 0 012.25 12c0-5.385 4.365-9.75 9.75-9.75s9.75 4.365 9.75 9.75-4.365 9.75-9.75 9.75z"/></svg>
        Chat with a Stylist
      </a>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%} Product Description  Accordion {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if product.description != blank -%}
      <details style="border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 1rem 0;">
        <summary style="font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif); font-size: 0.85rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; cursor: pointer; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
          Description <span>+</span>
        </summary>
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-muted); padding-top: 1rem;" itemprop="description">
          {{ product.description }}
        </div>
      </details>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%} Product Meta {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="lx-pdp__meta">
      {%- if current_variant.sku != blank -%}
        <span>SKU: {{ current_variant.sku }}</span>
      {%- endif -%}
      <span>Share</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%} *** MOBILE STICKY ATC BAR *** {%- endcomment -%}
<div class="lx-mobile-sticky">
  <div class="lx-mobile-sticky__price">{{ current_variant.price | money }}</div>
  {%- if current_variant.available -%}
    <button class="lx-atc" type="button">Add to Cart</button>
  {%- else -%}
    <button class="lx-atc" disabled>Sold Out</button>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Main Product (Luxury)",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-main-product",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": " Conversion Triggers"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_reviews",
      "label": "Show Star Rating",
      "default": true,
      "info": "Social proof  95% of users read reviews before buying (Baymard)."
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_scarcity",
      "label": "Show Low Stock Indicator",
      "default": true,
      "info": "Loss aversion  'Only X left' increases urgency by 27% (ConversionXL)."
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_emi",
      "label": "Show EMI Breakdown",
      "default": true,
      "info": "Price framing  monthly amount feels smaller than total price."
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_shipping_incentive",
      "label": "Show Free Shipping Threshold",
      "default": true,
      "info": "Reciprocity principle  perceived gift increases purchase intent."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "shipping_threshold",
      "label": "Free Shipping Threshold Text",
      "default": " Free shipping on orders over 999"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": " India-First Features"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_cod",
      "label": "Show COD Badge",
      "default": true,
      "info": "50%+ of India D2C orders are Cash on Delivery."
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_upi",
      "label": "Show UPI/Payment Badge",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_pincode",
      "label": "Show Pincode Checker",
      "default": true,
      "info": "Reduces delivery uncertainty  #1 friction point in India D2C."
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_certification",
      "label": "Show Certification Badge",
      "default": true,
      "info": "BIS Hallmark = government trust signal for Indian jewellery buyers."
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Main Product (Luxury)",
      "settings": {
        "show_reviews": true,
        "show_scarcity": true,
        "show_emi": true,
        "show_shipping_incentive": true,
        "show_cod": true,
        "show_upi": true,
        "show_pincode": true,
        "show_certification": true
      }
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}

